# React Engine — High-Level Overview

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor U as You
    participant A as Agent Composer
    participant E as ReAct Engine
    participant M as Memory
    participant L as LLM
    participant T as Tools / Skills

    U->>A: Send a message

    rect rgb(220, 240, 255)
        A->>M: Seen this before?
        alt Cached answer
            M-->>A: Return saved result
            A-->>U: Answer (instant)
        else First time
            M-->>E: Load conversation history
        end
    end

    rect rgb(220, 255, 230)
        loop Reason → Act (up to maxIterations)
            E->>L: What should I do next?

            rect rgb(255, 245, 200)
                alt Need more info
                    L-->>U: Ask a clarifying question
                    U-->>E: Answer (same conversation)
                else Call a tool or skill
                    E->>T: Execute
                    T-->>E: Result
                else Done
                    L-->>E: Final answer
                end
            end
        end
    end

    E->>M: Save conversation + cache result
    E-->>A: Final answer
    A-->>U: Response
```
